IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P1-annex-i`
IMPORT `P1-art6`

-- P1-tests-art6: tests for Article 6. Expected values come from the text (consolidated text lines 219 to 239; the base text lines 648 to 652 for paragraph 1 as enacted).
-- Dates: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027 (Annex III route) and 2 August 2028 (Annex I route) as amended; the Omnibus text is in force from 27 July 2026;
-- Article 6(5) and the Commission's powers are in the group General (from 2 August 2026). Article 111(2) saves an unchanged system placed on the market before the date of application.

§ `Article 6(1a), (1b): which AI systems qualify as safety components (as amended)`
-- intended to be used as a safety component and nothing excludes it
#ASSERT `Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- not a safety component under the definition and neither paragraph reaches it
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- solely non-safety aspects: 'shall not qualify as safety components' (paragraph 1a)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- failure would endanger health and safety: 'shall qualify' (paragraph 1b) even where the definition's other limb is not met
#ASSERT `Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- paragraph 1b prevails over 1a: 'Notwithstanding paragraph 1a'
#ASSERT `Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- paragraph 1b prevails over 1a also where the system was not otherwise a safety component
#ASSERT `Art 6(1a) and (1b) as amended the AI system qualifies as a safety component` FALSE TRUE TRUE

§ `Article 6(1c): a conformity assessment required solely for other risks`
-- a third-party conformity assessment is required, also for health and safety risks
#ASSERT `Art 6(1c) as amended the product fulfils the condition of paragraph 1, point (b)` TRUE FALSE
-- required solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety: 'shall not be considered as fulfilling the condition'
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1c) as amended the product fulfils the condition of paragraph 1, point (b)` TRUE TRUE)
-- no third-party conformity assessment is required
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1c) as amended the product fulfils the condition of paragraph 1, point (b)` FALSE FALSE)
-- no third-party conformity assessment is required, and the solely-other-risks fact does not create one
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1c) as amended the product fulfils the condition of paragraph 1, point (b)` FALSE TRUE)

§ `Article 6(1) as enacted: both conditions`
-- a safety component of a product covered by Section A legislation that requires a third-party conformity assessment
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE
-- the AI system is itself a product: 'or the AI system is itself a product'
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) FALSE TRUE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE
-- neither a safety component nor itself a product: condition (a) fails
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE)
-- no third-party conformity assessment: condition (b) fails
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE FALSE)
-- not covered by any legislation listed in Annex I: condition (a) fails
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I no listed legislation` FALSE TRUE)
-- item 1 (machinery directive) is listed in the text as enacted, on 26 July 2026
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` FALSE TRUE
-- item 21 does not exist in the text as enacted
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE TRUE)
-- Section B legislation counts: 'the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I'
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 14 Regulation (EU) No 168/2013` FALSE TRUE
-- item 20 is listed only in so far as the product is within the unmanned-aircraft part
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` FALSE TRUE)
-- item 20, within the part that Annex I lists
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` TRUE TRUE
-- before the Regulation is in force the Annex does not exist: not listed (the function answers a BOOLEAN, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as enacted the AI system is high-risk` (Date 31 7 2024) TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE)

§ `Article 6(1) as amended: both conditions, with paragraphs 1a, 1b, 1c`
-- a safety component of a product covered by Section A legislation that requires a third-party conformity assessment
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- the AI system is itself a product
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- neither a safety component nor itself a product
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- not covered by listed legislation
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I no listed legislation` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- no third-party conformity assessment
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- 1c: the assessment is required solely for risks other than health and safety
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- 1a: solely non-safety aspects, so not a safety component (and not itself a product)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- 1a does not help a system that is itself a product
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- 1b: failure would endanger health and safety: qualifies although 1a would exclude it
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- 1b: qualifies although the definition's other limb is not met
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- item 1 (machinery directive) is deleted by the Omnibus: not listed on 2 August 2028
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- item 21 (machinery regulation) is listed from 27 July 2026
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- item 20 outside the unmanned-aircraft part
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- item 20 inside the part
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) as amended the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` TRUE TRUE FALSE

§ `Article 6(1): the dispatcher, the gate and Article 111(2)`
-- the first day Chapter III applies to an Annex I system (2 August 2028)
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before (1 August 2028): not yet applicable
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 1 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- a system placed on 1 August 2028, asked on 2 August 2028: placed before the date of application, unchanged: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 1 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the same, significantly changed in its design since: not saved
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 1 8 2028) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed on the date of application itself: not saved (not 'before')
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed long before: saved
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the conditions fail (no third-party conformity assessment): JUST FALSE, not NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1a applies: solely non-safety aspects: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the Omnibus text, before it applies (27 July 2026)
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 27 7 2026) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the text as enacted (26 July 2026): never applied, NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before the Regulation is in force
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the Annex III date (2 December 2027) is not the Annex I date: NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 6(2) and (3): Annex III, the derogation, profiling`
-- an AI system referred to in Annex III shall be considered to be high-risk (2 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not referred to in Annex III: the class is handed to the list
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no significant risk and a narrow procedural task: the derogation applies
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no significant risk and improving the result of a previously completed human activity
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no significant risk and detecting patterns without replacing the human assessment
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no significant risk and a preparatory task
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no significant risk but none of (a) to (d): the derogation needs both, so still high-risk
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a condition of (a) to (d) but a significant risk: still high-risk
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- profiling of natural persons: 'always be considered to be high-risk', whatever the derogation
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III applies to Annex III systems (1 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 1 12 2027) (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- placed before the date of application and unchanged: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- placed before and significantly changed since: not saved
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- asked on the Annex I date: Chapter III applies to Annex III systems
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the text as enacted was never applicable (26 July 2026)
#ASSERT `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 26 7 2026) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 6: the route (seam S1)`
-- high-risk under both paragraphs: the Annex III route, which applies from the earlier date
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
-- Article 6(1) only
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
-- Article 6(1) only; Article 6(2) not yet applicable
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
-- Article 6(2) only
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
-- Article 6(2) only; Article 6(1) not yet applicable
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
-- neither paragraph makes it high-risk
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `Route neither`
-- Article 6(1) says no; Article 6(2) not yet applicable
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST `Route neither`
-- Article 6(2) says no; Article 6(1) not yet applicable
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST `Route neither`
-- neither paragraph applies yet
#ASSERT `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 6(4): document, register, provide`
-- the provider considers its Annex III system not high-risk
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the sentence is about 'such provider' only
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day before Chapter III applies to Annex III systems
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 1 12 2027) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day Chapter III applies to Annex III systems
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed before the date of application and unchanged: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- placed before but significantly changed since: not saved
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 6(4): the last day to document`
-- the day before the placing on the market (11 March 2028)
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 10 3 2028)
-- placed on 1 March 2028: the day before is 29 February 2028 (a leap year)
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 1 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 29 2 2028)
-- the provider does not consider its system not high-risk: the sentence is not about it
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day before Chapter III applies to Annex III systems
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` (Date 1 12 2027) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- placed before the date of application and unchanged: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 6(5), (6), (7), (8)`
-- provision group General applies from 2 August 2026; the deadline of Article 6(5) is 2 February 2026
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(5) the provision applies on the date asked under Article 113` (Date 1 8 2026))
-- the deadline day itself is before the group applies
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 6(5) the provision applies on the date asked under Article 113` (Date 2 2 2026))
-- the first day of the group General
#ASSERT `Art 6(5) the provision applies on the date asked under Article 113` (Date 2 8 2026)
-- concrete and reliable evidence
#ASSERT `Art 6(6) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to add or modify the conditions of paragraph 3` (Date 2 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no evidence: a failed 'where'
#ASSERT `Art 6(6) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to add or modify the conditions of paragraph 3` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before Chapter III Section 1 applies to Annex III systems (1 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 6(6) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to add or modify the conditions of paragraph 3` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- evidence that deleting is necessary
#ASSERT `Art 6(7) the Commission must adopt delegated acts deleting a condition of paragraph 3` (Date 2 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no evidence: a failed 'where' on a duty
#ASSERT `Art 6(7) the Commission must adopt delegated acts deleting a condition of paragraph 3` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before Chapter III Section 1 applies to Annex III systems (1 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 6(7) the Commission must adopt delegated acts deleting a condition of paragraph 3` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- does not decrease protection, consistent, takes account of developments
#ASSERT `Art 6(8) the amendment is within the limits that paragraph 8 sets` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- decreases the overall level of protection: 'shall not decrease'
#ASSERT `Art 6(8) the amendment is within the limits that paragraph 8 sets` (Date 2 12 2027) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not consistent with the delegated acts pursuant to Article 7(1)
#ASSERT `Art 6(8) the amendment is within the limits that paragraph 8 sets` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- does not take account of market and technological developments
#ASSERT `Art 6(8) the amendment is within the limits that paragraph 8 sets` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before Chapter III Section 1 applies to Annex III systems (1 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 6(8) the amendment is within the limits that paragraph 8 sets` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The rules: traces`
-- Article 6(4): the clock starts on the day the provider considers the system not high-risk (day 0) and runs to the day before the placing on the market (10 March 2028 is day 9 when the start is 1 March 2028).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (documented 3 days after the start)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) document the assessment` AT 3
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (documented on 10 March, the day before the placing)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) document the assessment` AT 9
-- EXPECT BREACH (documented on 11 March, the day of the placing: not 'before')
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) document the assessment` AT 10
-- EXPECT BREACH (documented after the placing)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) document the assessment` AT 20
-- EXPECT BREACH (the provider turns to the assessment on the day of the placing: no time is left)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 11 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) document the assessment` AT 0
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (the provider does not consider the system not high-risk: nothing owed)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE FALSE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (before Chapter III applies to Annex III systems: nothing owed)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 1 12 2027) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2028) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (placed before the date of application, unchanged: saved by Article 111(2), nothing owed)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to document the assessment before the AI system is placed on the market or put into service` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- EXPECT the duty stays on the provider (no time limit, no stated consequence): the rule with no breach path
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to provide the documentation of the assessment upon request` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (no request: nothing owed)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to provide the documentation of the assessment upon request` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (documentation provided)
#TRACE `Art 6(4) the duty to provide the documentation of the assessment upon request` (Date 1 3 2028) (Date 11 3 2028) FALSE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 6(4) provide the documentation of the assessment` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (guidelines provided on 2 February 2026, the last day)
#TRACE `Art 6(5) the duty of the Commission to provide guidelines` (Date 1 1 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 6(5) provide the guidelines` AT (((Day (Date 2 2 2026)) MINUS (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`)))
-- EXPECT BREACH (a day later)
#TRACE `Art 6(5) the duty of the Commission to provide guidelines` (Date 1 1 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 6(5) provide the guidelines` AT (((Day (Date 2 2 2026)) MINUS (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`)) PLUS 1)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (before the Regulation is in force: nothing owed)
#TRACE `Art 6(5) the duty of the Commission to provide guidelines` (Date 31 7 2024) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
